 Feeling smug from ascending a few Valkyries, I was quickly humbled
by playing the archeologist chracter. But at long last I finally managed
to ascend one but noticed a few unusual things along the way:

 (I hope the control L works...)



  In the past, my Valkyrie could contribute gold to a priestess of
another alignment, get her AC boosted and then kill the priestess
to reclaim her gold. The only penalty being a loss of the esp intrinsic.
However, when I tried this with the archeologist, upon killing the
priestess he lost his bonus AC. Is this due to being lawfully aligned?

  During the quest, the demon (or devil) that possessed the artifact
doubled, thus I had to kill two of them. Weirdly enough, both had
a bell of opening. So I marched around with two bells for the rest
of the game.

 And finally, since when will the Wizard attack you unprompted?
I was on the same level, but in the mazes rather than in his
tower, and he suddenly appeared taking shots at me. I had yet
to even enter his area, thus there was really no reason for him
to bother with me...

 Oh, and one benefit of playing on a public system - there's always
a fear of having the damn thing collapse while I'm in the endgame
(3 already have in the past!) and thus you learn to quickly resolve
things: 4 cursed scrolls of gold detection, a scroll of magic mapping
(for astral) and teleport control. And the whole thing takes less
the 10 minutes to finsh...

